20 0 obj
<< /A 539 0 R /Alt (Panel A shows Subject 1\220s glucose averages over time, with no data at baseline, marked improvement at 3 months on tirzepatide \(average 101 mg/dL, green bars\), high glucose after stopping tirzepatide \(average 278 mg/dL, orange bars\), and partial improvement after 6 months back on tirzepatide \(average 158 mg/dL, mixed green-yellow bars\). Panel B shows Subject 2 with high glucose at baseline \(average 249 mg/dL, orange bars\), improvement on tirzepatide \(average 172 mg/dL, green bars\), rising levels after a week off tirzepatide \(average 244 mg/dL, yellow-orange bars\), and no data after stopping tirzepatide.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 16 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
